ferrometer (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release.
  * Unix system metrics collector (CPU, memory, disk, filesystem, network, load, uname)
  * OTLP HTTP forwarder with gzip compression and basic auth
  * Feature-flagged components for minimal binary size
  * TOML configuration
  * Systemd service unit

